## 📈 **Performance Monitoring - Proaktiv Skalering**

### **Automatisk Skalering Triggers:**

**CPU Monitoring:**
```typescript
// Hvis CPU > 80% i 5 minutter → Start ny server
if (cpuUsage > 0.8 && duration > 300) {
  aws.ec2.startInstance(backupServer);
}
```

**Database Performance:**
```sql
-- Langsom query warning
SELECT query, mean_time 
FROM pg_stat_statements 
WHERE mean_time > 1000; -- Over 1 sekund
```

**Bruger Experience Metrics:**
```typescript
// Frontend performance tracking
performance.mark('case-load-start');
await loadCase(caseId);
performance.mark('case-load-end');

const loadTime = performance.measure(
  'case-load', 'case-load-start', 'case-load-end'
);

// Hvis load time > 3 sekunder → Alert
if (loadTime.duration > 3000) {
  analytics.track('slow-performance', { caseId, duration });
}
```

