## 🛡️ **Graceful Degradation - Systemet Virker Altid**

### **Når Ting Går Galt:**

**Database Overload:**
```typescript
// Fallback til cached data
try {
  const cases = await db.query.cases.findMany();
} catch (dbError) {
  console.warn('Database slow, using cache');
  const cases = await redis.get('cases-backup');
  return cases || [];
}
```

**WebSocket Failure:**
```typescript
// Automatisk fallback til polling
if (!websocket.connected) {
  console.log('WebSocket down, switching to polling');
  setInterval(fetchUpdates, 5000); // Poll hver 5 sekund
}
```

**Server Overload:**
```typescript
// Rate limiting for at beskytte systemet
const rateLimiter = rateLimit({
  windowMs: 1000, // 1 sekund
  max: req.user.role === 'admin' ? 100 : 10 // Admin får flere requests
});
```

